      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "トバリンは辺鄙な村じゃが、特産品をもとめて、\n旅人が毎年、遠路はるばる訪れるんじゃ。\n何もできんが、綺麗な舞の１つも見せてやりたい。\n砂漠を越えて来なければならんが、よろしく頼むぞ。",
        "official_en": "Twalinn is a remote village, but travelers come from\nfar and wide for our local specialties. If you don't\nmind the desert crossing, would you come and dance\nfor all of our visitors?",
        "real_en": "Tobalin is a remote village, but travelers come from\nfar and wide for our local specialties. If you don't\nmind the desert crossing, would you come and dance\nfor all of our visitors?"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
