      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "お前さんら、遠いところ大儀じゃったのう。\nじゃが、そのかいあって最高の舞台じゃったぞ。\n特産品もいつもよりよく売れたわい！\nほっほっほ、また頼むぞ！",
        "official_en": "You traveled for a noble cause, and the performance\nwas spectacular. It also means our local specialties\nsold even better than usual! Hohoho. Please come\nback sometime!",
